### Логин
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Получить все продукты
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### Получить все платформы
GET http://localhost:8080/api/platforms

### Получить корзину
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Добавить в корзину
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/add?productId=1&quantity=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Обновить количество в корзине
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/cart/update/1?quantity=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Удалить из корзины
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cart/remove/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Очистить корзину
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cart/clear
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Получить wishlist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Добавить в wishlist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/wishlist/add/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Удалить из wishlist
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/wishlist/remove/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Создать заказ
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "deliveryAddress": "Кишинёв, ул. Тестовая 1"
}

### Мои заказы
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Заказ по id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Создать категорию
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Консоли",
  "platform": { "id": 1 }
}

### Создать продукт
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "PlayStation 5",
  "description": "Новейшая консоль Sony PlayStation 5",
  "price": 499.99,
  "stock": 10,
  "imageUrl": "ps5.png",
  "platformId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Обновить продукт
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "PlayStation 5 Updated",
  "description": "Обновлённая консоль Sony",
  "price": 449.99,
  "stock": 15,
  "imageUrl": "ps5.png",
  "platformId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Удалить продукт
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Все пользователи (админ)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Все заказы (админ)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Обновить статус заказа (админ)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/orders/1/status?status=CONFIRMED
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Регистрация нового пользователя
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "firstName": "Тест",
  "lastName": "Тестов",
  "phoneNumber": "+373600000002"
}